      "response": {
        "_meta": null,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\n  \"matches\": [\n    {\n      \"chunk_id\": \"426386a246f608c2c2beb3a39aabebe06089e68b959690780093c5a0da77afa5\",\n      \"document_id\": \"assistant-policy\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"source_sha256\": \"1bafddd3595e088840bf9e53b28bd685fbaf20472b77ec40c89cff0c1c17aedb\",\n      \"source_file\": \"assistant-policy.md\",\n      \"section\": \"Explain limitations\",\n      \"text\": \"## Explain limitations\\n\\nSeparate observations, model scores and hypotheses. State that the dataset is synthetic when discussing applicability to real pumps. A stale feature response or unavailable service must be described as unavailable, not replaced with a remembered value.\",\n      \"cosine_similarity\": 0.4038443902430622\n    },\n    {\n      \"chunk_id\": \"a2bab1132dd65c3d7aa4850ac06c37007f2868d4b36602e14ca149450db43da4\",\n      \"document_id\": \"monitoring\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"source_sha256\": \"7a080ac6193902cf21bc22e1ff51eb22ce9466980a576a13803fc60ddae51218\",\n      \"source_file\": \"monitoring.md\",\n      \"section\": \"Vibration and operating load\",\n      \"text\": \"## Vibration and operating load\\n\\nVibration is measured in millimetres per second. In the simulator, vibration responds to wear, operating load and random measurement noise. A high vibration value alone does not prove that a failure has occurred. Compare its recent history with RPM, current, temperature and the operating-state flag. The coursework does not define a certified universal vibration alarm threshold.\",\n      \"cosine_similarity\": 0.37416938711347314\n    },\n    {\n      \"chunk_id\": \"cd1b36545d0a234e19f827acf4b62e02a9e5ad2001766374abf4281b17f210e6\",\n      \"document_id\": \"prediction\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"source_sha256\": \"d490874d40fa89aaa7a0669d00ca1f08e4175bff037244dab628682f14b62cea\",\n      \"source_file\": \"prediction.md\",\n      \"section\": \"Score and uncertainty\",\n      \"text\": \"## Score and uncertainty\\n\\nThe returned risk score comes from a model trained on synthetic data. It is not a calibrated probability for real industrial pumps. The assistant must identify the model version, feature timestamp and data provenance. It must not convert a high score into a claim that a physical failure is certain.\",\n      \"cosine_similarity\": 0.3408796404726654\n    }\n  ],\n  \"snapshot_sha256\": \"3538ac2e5d2a6c8b1cd1e7c4086e0bfd5e23edabffd0d82ed04062224ff899f1\",\n  \"embedding_revision\": \"1110a243fdf4706b3f48f1d95db1a4f5529b4d41\",\n  \"source_type\": \"authored-synthetic-reference\"\n}",
